.TH FUZZYGENE 1 2000-1月 "fuzzygene_edges" "fuzzygene_edges"
.SH NAME
fuzzygene_edges \- Export the signed regulatory edge table of a trained model.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIfuzzygene_edges(\fBfuzzygene\fR as <generic> FuzzyGeneModel, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Export the signed regulatory edge table of a trained model.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfuzzygene\fB \fR\- a trained model. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment used to report errors. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a data.frame with columns source, target, weight, regulation, confidence and prior
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
The edge weight is the average analytic partial derivative
 `∂x_target/∂x_regulator` over the training support: positive means activation,
 negative means repression. \fBconfidence\fR is the prior confidence when the edge is
 supported by the prior network, otherwise the absolute expression correlation.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
FuzzyGene
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
